{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Overture places taxonomy (schema v2) -> our subcategories. A rule matches the start of a place's taxonomy path ('a > b > c'); the longest matching rule wins. 'exclude' = not a business that could become a vendor. 'basic:<name>' rules are only used for places without a taxonomy path.",
